{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"814","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. An impassioned circulation of affection"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Nadeko's birthday is approaching! As she decorated the room for the party, a long garland of Dianthus-shaped paper pieces was placed on a prominent part of the wall. Brother Koyomi will like it!"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Still unsatisfied with the garland, Nadeko decided to polish it again. The garland has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" pieces numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" from left to right, and the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th piece has a colour "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"si"},{"kind":"text","text":", denoted by a lowercase English letter. Nadeko will repaint "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at most"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the pieces to give each of them an arbitrary new colour (still denoted by a lowercase English letter). After this work, she finds out all subsegments of the garland containing pieces of only colour "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":" — Brother Koyomi's favourite one, and takes the length of the longest among them to be the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Koyomity"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the garland."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For instance, let's say the garland is represented by \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"kooomo"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and Brother Koyomi's favourite colour is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"o"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". Among all subsegments containing pieces of \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"o"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" only, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ooo"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is the longest, with a length of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":". Thus the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Koyomity"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of this garland equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"But problem arises as Nadeko is unsure about Brother Koyomi's favourite colour, and has swaying ideas on the amount of work to do. She has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" plans on this, each of which can be expressed as a pair of an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"mi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and a lowercase letter "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":", meanings of which are explained above. You are to find out the maximum "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Koyomity"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" achievable after repainting the garland according to each plan."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains a positive integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 1 500"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the length of the garland."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lowercase English letters "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s1s2... sn"},{"kind":"text","text":" as a string — the initial colours of paper pieces on the garland."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains a positive integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ q ≤ 200 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of plans Nadeko has."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describe one plan each: the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th among them contains an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"mi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ mi ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the maximum amount of pieces to repaint, followed by a space, then by a lowercase English letter "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" — Koyomi's possible favourite colour."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines: for each work plan, output one line containing an integer — the largest "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Koyomity"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" achievable after repainting the garland according to it."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":